    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d14f558f_081fae06",
        "filename": "security/see/authmgr/aidl/android/hardware/security/see/authmgr/IAuthMgrAuthorization.aidl",
        "patchSetId": 28
      },
      "lineNbr": 230,
      "author": {
        "id": 1678423
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-11-12T18:54:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is the interface that should be implemented by any Trusted App that hosts a trusted service such as HWCrypto or SecureStorage. The interface is defined here: https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/platform/hardware/interfaces/+/3222485/23/security/see/authmgr/aidl/android/hardware/security/see/authmgr/ITrustedServicesCommonsConnect.aidl. It has a single method to allow the AuthMgr BE to handover an authorized connection to the trusted HAL service.\n\nWe do not intend to make this interface vendor stable, because it is only exposed within TEE for interaction between the AuthMgr BE TA and the TA(s) that hosts the trusted HAL services.",
      "parentUuid": "c36aa771_43e65558",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 230,
        "startChar": 44,
        "endLine": 230,
        "endChar": 74
      },
      "revId": "45cae2c1268eb98ab8a1a529a2b6a612817ca7a7",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b25adf55_a73f1b6b",
        "filename": "security/see/authmgr/aidl/android/hardware/security/see/authmgr/IAuthMgrAuthorization.aidl",
        "patchSetId": 28
      },
      "lineNbr": 239,
      "author": {
        "id": 1644679
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-11-11T23:48:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Are these unique to the VM? Where does this number come from?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 239,
        "startChar": 14,
        "endLine": 239,
        "endChar": 22
      },
      "revId": "45cae2c1268eb98ab8a1a529a2b6a612817ca7a7",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b9f29f28_da44bd3d",
        "filename": "security/see/authmgr/aidl/android/hardware/security/see/authmgr/IAuthMgrAuthorization.aidl",
        "patchSetId": 28
      },
      "lineNbr": 239,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000205
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-11-12T00:38:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is not required to be a globally unique ID. Each VM has a separate name-space. For a Linux based VM it could be a UID and for Trusty a UUID. Even in the trusty case where a UUID for different apps are globally unique, the same app could exists in multiple VMs.",
      "parentUuid": "b25adf55_a73f1b6b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 239,
        "startChar": 14,
        "endLine": 239,
        "endChar": 22
